## The Glass Door Animation

```
Closed (scroll < 0.3):        Open (scroll > 0.4):
┌──────┬──────┐               ┌──────          ──────┐
│      │      │               │        (open)        │
│ LEFT │RIGHT │  →→→          │                      │
│ DOOR │ DOOR │               │ LEFT ←         → RIGHT│
│      │      │               │DOOR              DOOR │
└──────┴──────┘               └──────          ──────┘

Animation: meshRef.rotation.y interpolates
  Left door:   0 → -Math.PI / 2   (swings left)
  Right door:  0 → +Math.PI / 2   (swings right)
  Triggered when scroll.offset crosses 0.3
  Duration: ~0.1 scroll units (smooth)
```

