## Performance Strategy

| Concern | Solution |
|---|---|
| 3D bundle size (~280KB) | `next/dynamic` + `ssr: false` — loads only on demand |
| Mobile GPU | 3D completely skipped on mobile (CSS only path) |
| Texture loading | Use low-res shop image for 3D scene background |
| Frame rate | `dpr={[1, 1.5]}` cap on Canvas, disable shadows on mid/low devices |
| LCP (Largest Contentful Paint) | Shop exterior image preloaded with `<link rel="preload">` |

